			<td class="col_content" style="width:70%; padding-left:10px;">
			<p>Please find below the expected business impact for your respective application/s:</p>

			<p><strong>Amadeus Publisher Database (PUB):</strong><br />
			<br />
			<strong>Airlines:</strong><br />
			<span style="font-size: 1.06rem; color: inherit;">1. Actions triggered by Time Initiated Actions (TIA's) or Event Initiated Actions (EIA's):</span></p>

			<p>During the outage of the database, no TIA's or EIA's will be processed, resulting in the absence of message generation and dispatch. This will be recovered right after the outage by re-sending all actions.</p>

			<p>2. Passenger Name Record (PNR) Data Feed:<br />
			Structured Booking Record (SBR) data feeds, both online and offline will be queued during the maintenance and sent with a delay preserving data and sequence; no data loss is anticipated. Scope of the action covers Ticketing Publication, Automated Ticketing functionalities, Departure Control System (DCS) Passenger Name List (PNL) and the Addition and Deletion List (ADL) activities.</p>

			<p>3. Flight Creation:<br />
			Flights scheduled for creation during the window will be queued and processed at the end of the maintenance.</p>

			<p>4. Customer Profiles:<br />
			Customer Profile creation, change and deletion traffic will not be processed during the maintenance, generating an error message for end users. Traffic will be re-injected after the outage leading to a delay on profile update/s.</p>

			<p>5. PNR Push to Customs:<br />
			PNR Push is sent to Customs triggered by TIA.<br />
			No PNR push will be generated or sent during the outage.<br />
			The Time Initiated Actions (TIAs) will be rescheduled after the maintenance window in order to trigger the &nbsp;generation of push reports. The impact will be a delay for the outage duration.<br />
			<br />
			<strong>Travel Channels:</strong><br />
			1. FeedTrip Feed: TTR Data feed will be queued during the maintenance and sent with a delay preserving data; no data loss is expected.&nbsp;<br />
			<br />
			2. Back Office Amadeus Interface Record (AIR):<br />
			Back office agents will not be able to display AIR content, listing, generate manual Information Management Record (IMR) and re-transmit manually AIR (BR entry) for all offices. This will result in an "unable to process" response during the maintenance.</p>
